  "details": "Sometimes you're happy to have an instance be generally joinable, but the content of discussion or roleplay is planned to be kind of heavy. It would be useful to have a way to give people a heads-up before joining. An example would be a group doing a horror roleplay on Halloween.\n\nIt could be something as simple as the warning text showing during loading, but a safety option to be prompted to confirm the warning before joining would be even better.",
